              " (extract-fr) section with name: the carpet-bag. [numbered in the document as: 2.]

@sen85   As most young candidates for the pains and penalties of whaling stop at this same New Bedford, thence to embark on their voyage, it may as well be related that I, for one, had no idea of so doing.

