@sen3143    While yet some distance from the Pequod, she rounded to, and dropping a boat, her captain was impelled towards us, impatiently standing in the bows instead of the stern.

              " (extract-fr) section with name: the pequod meets the virgin. [numbered in the document as: 81.]

@sen3144   "What has he in his hand there?" cried Starbuck, pointing to something wavingly held by the German.

