              " (extract-fr) section with name: the fountain. [numbered in the document as: 85.]

@sen3338    But the Sperm Whale's food is far beneath the surface, and there he cannot spout even if he would. Besides, if you regard him very closely, and time him with your watch, you will find that when unmolested, there is an undeviating rhyme between the periods of his jets and the ordinary periods of respiration.

              " (extract-fr) section with name: the fountain. [numbered in the document as: 85.]

