              " (extract-fr) section with name: a bower in the arsacides. [numbered in the document as: 102.]

@sen4040    There is a Leviathanic Museum, they tell me, in Hull, England, one of the whaling ports of that country, where they have some fine specimens of fin-backs and other whales.

