              " (extract-fr) section with name: the pequod meets the rachel. [numbered in the document as: 128.]

@sen4638    This way and that her yards were swung round; starboard and larboard, she continued to tack; now she beat against a head sea; and again it pushed her before it; while all the while, her masts and yards were thickly clustered with men, as three tall cherry trees, when the boys are cherrying among the boughs.

              " (extract-fr) section with name: the pequod meets the rachel. [numbered in the document as: 128.]

